<title>GERMANY: Dresdner to get 789 mln DM for Degussa.</title>
<headline>Dresdner to get 789 mln DM for Degussa.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Dresdner Bank AG said on Wednesday it would receive 789 million marks for the sale of its 9.9 percent stake in Degussa AG to utilities group Veba AG.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
